        "original_id": "d359ec9a-b514-5b14-8f4b-f2d3d74839de",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Reg Presley, Mike Newell, Charlotte Coleman\n- Works: Love Is All Around, Four Weddings and a Funeral, Love Actually, Oranges Are Not the Only Fruit, Worzel Gummidge, Marmalade Atkins\n- Places: Britain, England\n\nFacts:\n- Four Weddings and a Funeral is a 1994 British romantic comedy film directed by Mike Newell.\n- Charlotte Ninon Coleman (3 April 1968 – 14 November 2001) was an English actress best known for playing Scarlett in Four Weddings and a Funeral.\n- Charlotte Coleman was also known for playing Jess in the television drama Oranges Are Not the Only Fruit.\n- Charlotte Coleman also had childhood roles as Sue in Worzel Gummidge and in Marmalade Atkins.\n- Reg Presley wrote the song Love Is All Around.\n- Reg Presley’s song Love Is All Around was featured in the films Four Weddings and a Funeral and Love Actually.",
